Virat Kohli RAG Application
1. Project Overview

Explain that the project is a Retrieval-Augmented Generation application that answers questions about Virat Kohli using information stored in your document.

Mention that the project supports two vector databases:

FAISS
Pinecone

And uses:

Sentence Transformers for embeddings
Groq for LLM responses
FastAPI for REST API
Postman for API testing
Docker for containerization
