PINECONE_INDEX_NAME=kohli-index

Add an important security note:

Never commit the .env file to GitHub.

Your .gitignore should contain:

.env
end/
__pycache__/
8. Embedding Model

Explain that you use:

all-MiniLM-L6-v2

It converts text into 384-dimensional embeddings.

This is important because your Pinecone index uses:

dimension=384
