13. API Endpoints

Document your endpoints:

Health Check
GET /

Response:

{
    "message": "Virat Kohli RAG API is running"
}
FAISS
POST /ask/faiss

Request:

{
    "question": "Who is Virat Kohli?"
}

Response:

{
    "vector_store": "FAISS",
    "question": "Who is Virat Kohli?",
    "answer": "..."
}
Pinecone
POST /ask/pinecone

Request:

{
    "question": "Who is Virat Kohli?"
}

Response:

{
    "vector_store": "Pinecone",
    "question": "Who is Virat Kohli?",
    "answer": "..."
}
