15. Docker

Add Docker instructions after your FastAPI section.

Build
docker build --no-cache -t rag_pipeline .
Run 
docker run -p 8000:8000 --env-file .env rag_pipeline



Then test:

http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs

And use Postman against the Dockerized API.

